# Sass build output. `npm run sass` writes this with --style=compressed, so
# Prettier would un-minify it on every commit and Sass would re-compress it on
# the next build -- a few thousand lines of churn each way, and a source map
# that no longer matches the file it describes. Mirrors the same entry in
# .stylelintrc.json's ignoreFiles.
src/styles/index.css
src/styles/index.css.map
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Plan specs are parsed by build-plan-html.mjs, which does not unescape
# Prettier's defensive backslashes (e.g. \_navigation.scss)
docs/plans/*.md

